' Second view over the same domain as inventory-domain.puml.
'
' Warehouse, StockItem and Supplier appear in both diagrams. Because the index lists them as
' views of one model, PlantUML derives the same element ids from the same names, so each of
' those is ONE arch:Element depicted by two views — not two unrelated resources.
@startuml
title Stock Replenishment
class Warehouse
class StockItem
class Supplier
class PurchaseOrder {
  +number: String
  +raisedAt: DateTime
}
Warehouse --> StockItem : monitors
StockItem --> PurchaseOrder : triggers
PurchaseOrder --> Supplier : sentTo
Supplier --> Warehouse : delivers
@enduml
